    "detailed_description": "<h1>Find Out And Contact Us</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BiliBili &amp; Small Black Box &amp; Rednote: \u77b3\u7535\u6e38\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: publish@tdgame.studio</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop Party is a multiplayer party game that can be played by up to 6 players at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as cute animals in the game, and knock players from other teams out of the field through direct collisions or basketballs to win the game and experience the joy of bumper cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple modes in the game, each with a different objective, and a completely different fun experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can play cute little animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique multiplayer bumper car experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse level modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support online connection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports controllers and keyboards</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop Party is a multiplayer party game that can be played by up to 6 players at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as cute animals in the game, and knock players from other teams out of the field through direct collisions or basketballs to win the game and experience the joy of bumper cars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple modes in the game, each with a different objective, and a completely different fun experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can play cute little animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique multiplayer bumper car experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse level modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support online connection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports controllers and keyboards</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Pop Party is a multiplayer party party game. Players play as critters using their bodies and basketballs to try and knock players from other teams out of the field and emerge victorious in a variety of game modes!",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese",
